1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:01,349
(Leonard:)- Hi.
- Hello.

2
00:00:01,809 --> 00:00:03,519
(Girl:)So, what are you supposed to be?

3
00:00:03,686 --> 00:00:05,226
(Leonard:)Me?

4
00:00:05,396 --> 00:00:07,486
(Sheldon:)I'll give you a hint.

5
00:00:07,649 --> 00:00:09,229
Vroom.

6
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,610
(Girl:)A choo-choo train?

7
00:00:12,028 --> 00:00:13,908
(Leonard:)Close.

8
00:00:14,072 --> 00:00:15,862
Vroom.

9
00:00:16,032 --> 00:00:18,112
A brain-damaged choo-choo train?

10
00:00:20,411 --> 00:00:23,411
(Sheldon:)How wasted am I?

11
00:00:23,581 --> 00:00:25,211
Dancing all by myself

12
00:00:25,375 --> 00:00:28,585
Cannot control the beat
When you make me weak

13
00:00:31,422 --> 00:00:32,462
Vroom.

14
00:00:32,632 --> 00:00:34,552
[UNDER THE INFLUENCE OF GIANTS'
"MAMA'S ROOM" PLAYS ON STEREO]

15
00:00:34,717 --> 00:00:35,717
(Girl:)I still don't get it.

16
00:00:35,885 --> 00:00:37,635
(Sheldon:)I'm the Doppler effect.

17
00:00:37,804 --> 00:00:40,224
(Girl:)Okay, if that is some sort
of learning disability...

18
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:42,560
(Girl:)...I think it's very insensitive.

19
00:00:43,810 --> 00:00:46,400
(Leonard:)Why don't you just tell people
you're a zebra?

20
00:00:47,230 --> 00:00:50,320
(Leonard:)Why don't you just tell people
you're one of the seven dwarves?

21
00:00:50,483 --> 00:00:51,613
(Leonard:)Because I'm Frodo.

22
00:00:51,776 --> 00:00:54,696
(Sheldon:)Yes, well, I'm the Doppler effect.

23
00:00:55,655 --> 00:00:57,655
- Oh, no.
- What?

24
00:00:58,074 --> 00:00:59,824
(Leonard:)That's Penny's ex-boyfriend.

25
00:00:59,992 --> 00:01:01,702
(Sheldon:)What do you suppose he's doing here?

